<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="es">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>FRONTERA CERO - Main Menu</title>
    <style>
        :root {
            --bg-dark: #0b1021;
            --panel-bg: #131a2e;
            --card-bg: #1c243d;
            --accent-yellow: #ffcc00;
            --text-main: #ffffff;
            --text-muted: #8b9bb4;
            --border-color: #2e3b5a;
            --font-stack: 'Segoe UI', 'Roboto', 'Helvetica Neue', sans-serif;
        }

        * {
            box-sizing: border-box;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
        }

        body {
            background-color: var(--bg-dark);
            color: var(--text-main);
            font-family: var(--font-stack);
            height: 100vh;
            width: 100vw;
            overflow: hidden;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            /* Simulating the grid background */
            background-image: 
                linear-gradient(rgba(30, 58, 138, 0.3) 1px, transparent 1px),
                linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(30, 58, 138, 0.3) 1px, transparent 1px);
            background-size: 40px 40px;
        }

        /* --- Header Section --- */
        header {
            text-align: center;
            padding-top: 20px;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
            position: relative;
            z-index: 10;
        }

        h1 {
            font-size: 3.5rem;
            font-weight: 900;
            letter-spacing: 2px;
            line-height: 1;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            font-style: italic;
            margin-bottom: 5px;
            text-shadow: 0 4px 10px rgba(0,0,0,0.5);
        }

        .title-white { color: #fff; }
        .title-yellow { color: var(--accent-yellow); }

        .subtitle {
            color: #38bdf8; /* Cyan-ish blue */
            font-size: 0.9rem;
            letter-spacing: 3px;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            font-weight: 600;
            opacity: 0.9;
        }

        /* --- Navigation Tabs --- */
        nav.tabs {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            gap: 15px;
            margin-bottom: 25px;
        }

        .tab-btn {
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
            border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
            color: var(--text-main);
            padding: 12px 35px;
            font-size: 1rem;
            font-weight: 700;
            cursor: pointer;
            border-radius: 6px;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 10px;
            transition: all 0.2s ease;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            clip-path: polygon(10px 0, 100% 0, 100% calc(100% - 10px), calc(100% - 10px) 100%, 0 100%, 0 10px); /* Slight cut corners */
        }

        .tab-btn.active {
            background: linear-gradient(to bottom, #ffd700, #f59e0b);
            color: #000;
            border-color: #ffd700;
            box-shadow: 0 0 15px rgba(255, 204, 0, 0.4);
            transform: translateY(-2px);
        }

        .tab-btn:not(.active):hover {
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
            border-color: #555;
        }

        .icon { font-size: 1.1em; }

        /* --- Main Content Layout --- */
        main {
            flex: 1;
            display: flex;
            gap: 20px;
            padding: 0 40px 40px 40px;
            max-width: 1600px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            width: 100%;
            overflow-y: auto;
        }

        /* Left Column */
        .col-left {
            flex: 1.4;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            gap: 20px;
            min-width: 0; /* Flexbox fix */
        }

        /* Right Column */
        .col-right {
            flex: 1;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            gap: 15px;
        }

        /* --- Panels & Cards --- */
        .panel-header {
            font-size: 0.85rem;
            color: var(--text-muted);
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 1px;
            margin-bottom: 8px;
            font-weight: 600;
        }

        .input-box {
            background: #0f1525;
            border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
            border-radius: 8px;
            padding: 15px 20px;
            color: #aaa;
            font-size: 1rem;
            outline: none;
            width: 100%;
            transition: border 0.2s;
        }
        .input-box:focus { border-color: var(--accent-yellow); }

        /* Action Row (Bots, Create, Join) */
        .action-row {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: 1.2fr 1fr 1fr;
            gap: 15px;
        }

        .action-card {
            background: var(--card-bg);
            border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
            border-radius: 8px;
            padding: 15px;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            justify-content: center;
            cursor: pointer;
            transition: transform 0.2s, border-color 0.2s;
            position: relative;
        }

        .action-card:hover {
            border-color: #666;
            transform: translateY(-2px);
        }

        .action-card.selected {
            border-color: var(--accent-yellow);
            background: rgba(255, 204, 0, 0.08);
            box-shadow: inset 0 0 10px rgba(255, 204, 0, 0.1);
        }

        .action-icon {
            font-size: 1.2rem;
            margin-bottom: 8px;
            color: var(--accent-yellow);
        }

        .action-title {
            font-weight: 800;
            font-size: 0.9rem;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            margin-bottom: 4px;
        }

        .action-desc {
            font-size: 0.75rem;
            color: var(--text-muted);
            line-height: 1.3;
        }

        /* Game Mode Grid */
        .mode-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
            gap: 15px;
        }

        .mode-card {
            background: var(--card-bg);
            border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
            border-radius: 8px;
            padding: 18px;
            cursor: pointer;
            transition: all 0.2s;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            justify-content: space-between;
            min-height: 110px;
        }

        .mode-card:hover {
            border-color: #888;
            background: #232d47;
        }

        .mode-card.selected {
            border: 1px solid var(--accent-yellow);
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(255,204,0,0.1), transparent);
        }

        .mode-header {
            display: flex;
            align-items: flex-start;
            gap: 10px;
            margin-bottom: 8px;
        }

        .mode-icon {
            color: var(--text-muted);
            font-size: 1.1rem;
            margin-top: 2px;
        }

        .mode-card.selected .mode-icon { color: var(--accent-yellow); }

        .mode-title {
            font-weight: 800;
            font-size: 0.9rem;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            line-height: 1.2;
        }

        .mode-desc {
            font-size: 0.75rem;
            color: var(--text-muted);
            line-height: 1.4;
        }

        /* Difficulty Bar */
        .difficulty-bar {
            display: flex;
            gap: 10px;
            margin-top: 5px;
        }

        .diff-btn {
            flex: 1;
            background: transparent;
            border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
            color: var(--text-muted);
            padding: 10px;
            border-radius: 6px;
            font-size: 0.8rem;
            font-weight: 700;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            cursor: pointer;
            transition: all 0.2s;
        }

        .diff-btn.active {
            background: var(--accent-yellow);
            color: #000;
            border-color: var(--accent-yellow);
            box-shadow: 0 4px 10px rgba(255, 204, 0, 0.2);
        }

        /* Right Side News List */
        .news-list {
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            gap: 12px;
        }

        .news-item {
            background: var(--card-bg);
            border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
            border-radius: 8px;
            padding: 15px;
            display: flex;
            gap: 15px;
            align-items: flex-start;
        }

        .news-icon {
            color: #38bdf8;
            font-size: 1.2rem;
            margin-top: 2px;
        }

        .news-content h4 {
            font-size: 0.9rem;
            font-weight: 700;
            margin-bottom: 4px;
            color: #eee;
        }

        .news-content p {
            font-size: 0.75rem;
            color: var(--text-muted);
            line-height: 1.4;
        }

        /* Footer Logo Placeholder */
        .footer-logo {
            position: fixed;
            bottom: 20px;
            left: 20px;
            width: 40px;
            height: 40px;
            background: #000;
            border-radius: 50%;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            font-weight: bold;
            border: 2px solid #333;
            z-index: 100;
        }

        /* Responsive */
        @media (max-width: 1200px) {
            main { flex-direction: column; overflow-y: auto; }
            .col-right { display: none; } /* Hide news on smaller screens to focus on gameplay settings as per screenshot structure usually implies priority */
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <header>
        <h1><span class="title-white">FRONTERA</span> <span class="title-yellow">CERO</span></h1>
        <div class="subtitle">FPS Táctico Multijugador · Temporada 3</div>
    </header>

    <nav class="tabs">
        <button class="tab-btn active">
            <span class="icon">▶</span> Jugar
        </button>
        <button class="tab-btn">
            <span class="icon">⌨</span> Controles
        </button>
        <button class="tab-btn">
            <span class="icon">⚙</span> Ajustes
        </button>
        <button class="tab-btn">
            <span class="icon">ℹ</span> Información
        </button>
    </nav>

    <main>
        <!-- Left Column: Gameplay Settings -->
        <section class="col-left">

            <div>
                <div class="panel-header">Nombre del Operador</div>
                <input type="text" class="input-box" placeholder="Introduce tu nombre de combate" value="">
            </div>

            <div class="action-row">
                <!-- Card 1 -->
                <article class="action-card selected">
                    <div class="action-icon">🤖</div>
                    <div class="action-title">Bots</div>
                    <div class="action-desc">Escaramuza 4v4 contra IA</div>
                </article>
                <!-- Card 2 -->
                <article class="action-card">
                    <div class="action-icon">👥</div>
                    <div class="action-title">Crear Sala</div>
                    <div class="action-desc">1v1 con código P2P</div>
                </article>
                <!-- Card 3 -->
                <article class="action-card">
                    <div class="action-icon">🔗</div>
                    <div class="action-title">Unirse</div>
                    <div class="action-desc">Entra con un código</div>
                </article>
            </div>

            <div>
                <div class="panel-header" style="display:flex; align-items:center; gap:8px;">
                    <span>⚔️</span> MODO DE JUEGO
                </div>
                <div class="mode-grid">
                    <!-- Mode 1 -->
                    <article class="mode-card selected">
                        <div class="mode-header">
                            <span class="mode-icon">⚔️</span>
                            <div class="mode-title">Combate de Equipos</div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="mode-desc">4 vs 4 · la primera escuadra en llegar al objetivo gana la ronda</div>
                    </article>

                    <!-- Mode 2 -->
                    <article class="mode-card">
                        <div class="mode-header">
                            <span class="mode-icon">⚡</span>
                            <div class="mode-title">Todos Contra Todos</div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="mode-desc">Operador contra operador · la primera racha individual gana</div>
                    </article>

                    <!-- Mode 3 -->
                    <article class="mode-card">
                        <div class="mode-header">
                            <span class="mode-icon">🚩</span>
                            <div class="mode-title">Capturar La Bandera</div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="mode-desc">Roba la bandera rival y llévala a tu base · primero a 3 capturas</div>
                    </article>

                    <!-- Mode 4 -->
                    <article class="mode-card">
                        <div class="mode-header">
                            <span class="mode-icon">🎯</span>
                            <div class="mode-title">Dominación</div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="mode-desc">Toma y conserva las 3 zonas del mapa · primero a 150 puntos</div>
                    </article>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div>
                <div class="panel-header" style="display:flex; align-items:center; gap:8px;">
                    <span>🎮</span> DIFICULTAD DE LA IA
                </div>
                <div class="difficulty-bar">
                    <button class="diff-btn">Fácil</button>
                    <button class="diff-btn active">Normal</button>
                    <button class="diff-btn">Difícil</button>
                    <button class="diff-btn">Experto</button>
                </div>
            </div>

        </section>

        <!-- Right Column: News/Info -->
        <aside class="col-right">
            <div class="panel-header" style="color:var(--accent-yellow); display:flex; align-items:center; gap:8px;">
                <span>⚡</span> NOVEDADES DE LA TEMPORADA 3
            </div>

            <div class="news-list">
                <article class="news-item">
                    <div class="news-icon">⚔️</div>
                    <div class="news-content">
                        <h4>4 Modos de Juego</h4>
                        <p>Todos contra todos · Combate de equipos · Capturar la bandera · Dominación</p>
                    </div>
                </article>

                <article class="news-item">
                    <div class="news-icon">🏠</div>
                    <div class="news-content">
                        <h4>Ciudad nueva y ordenada</h4>
                        <p>Hotel de 3 plantas, torre de 4, mercado, almacenes y calles con asfalto</p>
                    </div>
                </article>

                <article class="news-item">
                    <div class="news-icon">📦</div>
                    <div class="news-content">
                        <h4>Armas y árbol reales (GLB)</h4>
                        <p>Modelos del repositorio integrados: pistola, SMG, rifle, francotirador y árboles</p>
                    </div>
                </article>

                <article class="news-item">
                    <div class="news-icon">🌐</div>
                    <div class="news-content">
                        <h4>Apuntado afinado</h4>
                        <p>Réticula compacta, retroceso reducido y ADS configurable</p>
                    </div>
                </article>

                <article class="news-item">
                    <div class="news-icon">🎮</div>
                    <div class="news-content">
                        <h4>Controles 100% asignables</h4>
                        <p>Disparar/apuntar con tecla o ratón · mando con correr en L3</p>
                    </div>
                </article>

                <article class="news-item">
                    <div class="news-icon">▲</div>
                    <div class="news-content">
                        <h4>Texturas del repositorio</h4>
                        <p>Cielo, paredes y suelo con las fotos subidas por la comunidad</p>
                    </div>
                </article>
            </div>
        </aside>
    </main>

    <div class="footer-logo">N</div>

</body>
</html>
